1:["$","$Ld",null,{"page":{"id":"library--crosstalk","kind":"library-article","route":"/roadmap/library/crosstalk","sourceUrl":"https://refold.la/roadmap/library/crosstalk","sourceHash":"7a869b4a1082aec3f0abc81919e936423aecdfbdaf0231ffdbc4335a8b509dec","collectedAt":"2026-09-01T16:52:45.133Z","bodyMode":"authorized-full-body","title":{"en":"Crosstalk","zh":"交叉对话"},"description":{"en":"","zh":""},"segments":[{"id":"segment-0001","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"Crosstalk is a conversation where each person speaks their native language. You speak your native language; your partner speaks the target language. This lets you focus entirely on understanding, without the stress of producing the language yourself.","zh":"交叉对话是每个人都使用自己母语进行的对话。你说自己的母语；你的搭档说目标语言。这样，你可以把注意力完全放在理解上，无需承受自己输出这门语言的压力。"}},{"id":"how-it-works","type":"heading","level":2,"content":{"en":"How It Works","zh":"如何进行"}},{"id":"segment-0003","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"Find a native speaker of your target language who is learning your native language. Have a normal conversation, but each person speaks the language they're most comfortable with. You speak English (or whatever your native language is), they speak the target language.","zh":"找一位正在学习你母语的目标语言母语者。像平常一样交谈，但双方都使用自己最熟悉的语言。你说英语（或你的任何母语），对方说目标语言。"}},{"id":"segment-0004","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"<strong>It sounds strange, but it works.</strong> Because both people are speaking comfortably, the conversation can be genuinely interesting — much more so than the stilted exchanges you'd have if both of you were struggling in your second languages.","zh":"<strong>这听起来很奇怪，但确实有效。</strong>因为双方都能轻松自如地说话，对话可以真正变得有趣——比起两个人都磕磕绊绊地使用第二语言交流，这种方式有趣得多。"}},{"id":"why-its-effective","type":"heading","level":2,"content":{"en":"Why It's Effective","zh":"为什么它有效"}},{"id":"segment-0006","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"Conversations are two sided: you must speak <em>and</em> listen. Trying to do both while you're still a beginner is very difficult.","zh":"对话是双向的：你既要说，<em>也</em>要听。在你仍是初学者时，试图同时做到这两点非常困难。"}},{"id":"segment-0007","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"Crosstalk trains the <strong>comprehension</strong> side of conversation. In a real conversation, you need to understand someone speaking directly to you, at natural speed, about unpredictable topics. Crosstalk gives you practice with exactly this, without the added cognitive load of speaking.","zh":"交叉对话训练的是对话中的<strong>理解能力</strong>。在真实对话中，你需要听懂别人以自然语速直接对你谈论无法预料的话题。交叉对话恰好能让你练习这一点，同时不会增加开口说话带来的认知负担。"}},{"id":"segment-0008","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"Then, once you're comfortable with understanding, adding in speaking is much easier.","zh":"等你能轻松理解之后，再加入说话练习就容易得多。"}},{"id":"segment-0009","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"It also has social benefits. You can make real friends through crosstalk very early on in your learning journey, because the conversations are enjoyable for both people from the start.","zh":"它还能带来社交上的好处。在学习旅程的早期，你就可以通过交叉对话结交真正的朋友，因为这种对话从一开始就能让双方乐在其中。"}},{"id":"finding-partners","type":"heading","level":2,"content":{"en":"Finding Partners","zh":"寻找搭档"}},{"id":"segment-0011","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"Look for native speakers of your target language who are learning your native language. Language exchange apps (Tandem, HelloTalk) and online communities are the easiest places to find them. If you have family members who speak the target language, crosstalk can feel very natural.","zh":"寻找正在学习你母语的目标语言母语者。语言交换应用（Tandem、HelloTalk）和在线社区是最容易找到他们的地方。如果你的家人中有人说目标语言，交叉对话会显得非常自然。"}},{"id":"tips","type":"heading","level":2,"content":{"en":"Tips","zh":"建议"}},{"id":"segment-0013","type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"en":"Don't be afraid to ask your partner to repeat something or say it differently","zh":"不要害怕请搭档重复一遍，或换一种说法"},{"en":"You can use gestures, facial expressions, and context to fill in gaps","zh":"你可以利用手势、面部表情和语境来补足理解上的空缺"},{"en":"Aim for 2-3 crosstalk sessions per week during Phase 3D","zh":"在阶段 3D，争取每周进行 2～3 次交叉对话"},{"en":"Crosstalk is a listening exercise, not a speaking one","zh":"交叉对话是听力练习，而不是口语练习"}]},{"id":"when-to-start","type":"heading","level":2,"content":{"en":"When to Start","zh":"何时开始"}},{"id":"segment-0015","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"Crosstalk is introduced in Phase 3D as preparation for real conversation in Phase 4, but you can start it as early as you want! It's especially powerful if you're learning the language of family members or close friends.","zh":"交叉对话在阶段 3D 引入，目的是为阶段 4 的真实对话做准备，但只要你愿意，也可以更早开始！如果你学习的是家人或好友使用的语言，这种练习尤其有效。"}}],"cards":[]},"siteBasePath":"/my_learning_docs"}]
